model {
  extend basalt.toolsGateway.accountRechecks {
    metadata {
      constraint "Account health rechecks use bounded cron dispatch with authority-checked leases and provider cooldowns. Hosted migration 17 adds the persistent queue and provider deadlines. Legacy hosted fixtures remove these objects and the journal row together before replaying earlier migrations; an upgrade recreates them once and keeps its receipts across restarts. Background execution preserves both v1 import entry points and their request layers; the recheck scheduler cannot replace those handlers or their invocation authority. The shared job route preserves explicit upstream outcomes and records completion only after a legacy void job settles."
    }
  }
}
